garden - guava tree
- prune in late winter (feb), before new growth
- cut out branches that cross or rub, and the ones growing inward
- a big branch split in the storm: cut cleanly below the split and seal it
- remove suckers at the base
- leaves had white spots: mealybugs? spray neem oil weekly for a month
- gardener comes on the 1st and 15th, PKR 1,500 per visit
